{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117121","id":3361167254,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7IV1eW","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117121","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117121.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117121.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117121","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117121/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117121/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117121/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a82592de3e7ed135ac394a588583b26273a84e4e","number":117121,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[POC] GDScript: Reduce call overhead for functions that don't use `self` or class","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Note:\r\n- Better solution for `CLASS`: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117850\r\n\r\nWhen a GDScript function gets called there is an overhead from setting up and cleaning up the stack. Some of that time is spent referencing and unreferencing the script and the instance, because we always make those available on the stack and storing them in a variant triggers ref counting.\r\n\r\nFor functions that don't actually use those stack entries this work isn't really necessary. This PR saves whether a function uses self or its class. And if not leaves those stack spaces uninitialized, in an attempt to reduce the call overhead in some situations.\r\n\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>For a very specific benchmark that tests a pure function that just does math I see around a 10% improvement.</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nvar iter : int = 1_000_000\r\nvar test_strick : float = 0.0\r\nvar time : float = 0.0\r\n\r\nfunc sqrt_v1(num:int) -> float:\r\n\treturn num**0.5\r\n\t\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tfor ii in range(5):\r\n\t\ttime = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\t\tfor i:int in range(iter):\r\n\t\t\ttest_strick += sqrt_v1(i)\r\n\t\tprint(Time.get_unix_time_from_system() - time)\r\n\tget_tree().quit()\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nHowever this is unlikely to translate to real projects, since a most functions will need those stack entries. I don't have any realistic projects to test against so I'll just put it as draft for now.\r\n\r\nActual benchmark data (benchmark script slightly altered): [stack_uninit.ods](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26064276/stack_uninit.ods)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-05T22:24:56Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T14:18:47Z","closed_at":"2026-04-20T14:18:19Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"HolonProduction:gdscript/poc-stack-uninit","ref":"gdscript/poc-stack-uninit","repo":{"id":546746307,"node_id":"R_kgDOIJavww","name":"godot","full_name":"HolonProduction/godot","owner":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users